script 5 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DrGoodall
	"이제 같은 실수를\n계속 반복하지\n않겠죠."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럼 이만하면\n끝난 것 같네요."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럼 안녕히...\n뭐라고 하셨죠?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정말 미안하다면\n벌을 없애 주겠냐고요?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그건 좀 곤란하겠는걸요,\n어린 친구."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"세상에는 질서를 지키기 위한\n규칙이 있고,"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"규칙을 어긴 사람에게는\n벌이 따르는 법이에요."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"진심으로\n미안하다고요?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"글쎄요..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"......"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"......"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"......"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋아요. 정말로\n미안해하는지 확실히\n알아봐야겠네요."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러니 자신이 무슨 일을 했는지\n생각해 보고"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"스스로를 돌아볼 시간을\n조금 드릴게요."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"알겠죠?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋아요, 시작!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	msgOpen
	soundPlay
		sound = 540
	cmdEC18
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"자아성찰..."
	soundPlay
		sound = 540
	msgClose
	clearMsg
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DrGoodall
	"좋아요. 아주 잘했어요,\n"
	var1PrintString
	". 이번에는 벌을 주지\n않고 용서해 드릴게요."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	jumpIfChapterSub000E
		chapter = 0
		target = 6
	jump
		target = 7
	end
}
